LAVS Trading and Cortijo de Palsabangon Farm OPC have launched a joint erosion-control initiative bringing hardscaping expertise to watersheds near the farm, pairing nature-based materials with community outreach.

The program uses coco nets and geotextiles supplied through LAVS Trading's coconut-fibre product line, with replanting led by trained local growers from Cortijo's farm school network. It's the first initiative to formally combine both enterprises' capabilities under one community program.
